---
/**
 * ScrollWorld — the lets-scroll camera flight through the studio.
 *
 * Architecture A (continuous walkthrough): six forward legs, NO connectors.
 * Each leg starts on the previous leg's actual last frame, so the seams are
 * frame-identical and the camera never reverses.
 *
 * Until the clips are rendered, the `clip` / `clipMobile` / `stillMobile` keys
 * below stay commented and the engine simply cross-dissolves the stills. Drop
 * the encoded files into /world/vid/, uncomment, and nothing else changes.
 * See world/HANDOFF.md for the render spec.
 */

